cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite the following."
type: software
title: "DFT vertical-swap Ca²⁺/Ln³⁺ discriminator (alchemical_bvs)"
abstract: >
  A DFT cluster-level methodology pipeline for scoring whether a candidate
  metal-binding pocket in a protein structure prefers Ca²⁺ or Ln³⁺ at the
  coordination-chemistry level. For each candidate, the pipeline carves a
  first-shell QM cluster (metal + ASP/GLU/ASN/GLN/SER/TYR sidechains + any
  PQQ cofactor + backbone-O contacts), runs four r²SCAN-3c / CPCM(Water)
  single points (La form, Ca form, apo, bulk water), and computes a single
  ΔΔE score in kcal/mol against a fixed aquo reference. Production scale
  at 1,453 candidates with the XoxF/MxaF gold-standard pair as the
  31-kcal/mol-gap validation anchor.
